    "original_description": "CELDYQUE Azelaic Acid 12% Serum combines Azelaic Acid, Salicylic Acid, Tranexamic Acid, Niacinamide, Centella, Panthenol, Ceramide, Hyaluronic Acid and a Vitamin C derivative for redness appearance, acne-prone and dark spot care.",
    "original_ingredient_text": "Key Ingredients Azelaic Acid · BHA · TXA · Cica Redness CareBHATone CareLightweight Key Ingredients: Azelaic Acid 12%, Tranexamic Acid, Salicylic Acid, Niacinamide, Centella Asiatica Extract, Panthenol, Ceramide NP, Hyaluronic Acid and a Vitamin C derivative. Benefits: Redness appearance care, acne-prone routine support, spot fading appearance and even-looking tone. Texture: Lightweight, non-greasy serum that layers well under makeup. Refer to the product packaging for the complete and most current ingredient list. For external use only. Avoid direct contact with the eyes. Perform a patch test before first use. Discontinue use if persistent irritation occurs. Keep out of reach of children.",
